00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.770
So it's the next day, I just
got off the phone with Jason.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.702
He said he can meet up
tomorrow in Brooklyn, so

00:01:23.702 --> 00:01:25.543
